{"publicId":"660bd3de-8ba0-4cc7-acb6-b89bc2a2be25","title":"工信部批准274项行业标准，涵盖人工智能等领域","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T00:59:31.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T00:59:31.000Z","digest":"工业和信息化部于2026年11月17日批准了包括电子、机械、汽车、轻工、纺织等行业在内的274项行业标准，其中明确包含《人工智能 关键基础技术 具身智能数据生成系统技术要求》等文件。该批标准覆盖技术研发、产品测试、应用规范等全链条环节，涉及人工智能基础技术、智能制造装备、新能源汽车零部件等具体领域。根据36氪报道，工信部通过该批标准强化了重点行业技术标准体系的完整性，但未披露具体实施时间表或行业覆盖比例。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T01:27:33.030Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"工信部批准274项行业标准","latestReport":{"id":"mj25b2oo69slizu4qls0ozn7a"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fH0N0m-U5unk","title":"工业和信息化部批准274项行业标准","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T00:59:31.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mj25b2oo69slizu4qls0ozn7a","title":"工信部批准274项行业标准","summary":"工业和信息化部批准了包括电子、机械、汽车、轻工、纺织等行业在内的274项行业标准。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T00:59:31.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mj25b2oo69slizu4qls0ozn7a","title":"工信部批准274项行业标准","summary":"工业和信息化部批准了包括电子、机械、汽车、轻工、纺织等行业在内的274项行业标准。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T00:59:31.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T10:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T11:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"p